# q10 · Does Pad Thai contain peanuts, also hidden inside products?
PREFIX rec:      <https://sdsc-ordes.github.io/rdf-training/vocab/recipes#>
PREFIX recipe:   <https://sdsc-ordes.github.io/rdf-training/id/recipe/>
PREFIX allergen: <https://sdsc-ordes.github.io/rdf-training/id/allergen/>

ASK {
  recipe:pad-thai rec:hasIngredient/rec:containsIngredient*/rec:hasAllergen allergen:peanuts .
}
